<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Van Essen (1997), Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) & Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) cortico-cortical axonal tension and cortical folding (Primate & mammalian cerebral cortex and white-matter tracts (Homo sapiens, Macaca mulatta, Pan troglodytes, Tursiops truncatus, Felis catus, Mus musculus))",
        "Van Essen (1997), Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) & Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) cortico-cortical axonal tension and cortical folding faithfully reproduces Primate & mammalian cerebral cortex and white-matter tracts (Homo sapiens, Macaca mulatta, Pan troglodytes, Tursiops truncatus, Felis catus, Mus musculus) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Primate & mammalian cerebral cortex and white-matter tracts (Homo sapiens, Macaca mulatta, Pan troglodytes, Tursiops truncatus, Felis catus, Mus musculus) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 53.9/100, audit 2026-10-19-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py> ;
    schema:about "Primate & mammalian cerebral cortex and white-matter tracts (Homo sapiens, Macaca mulatta, Pan troglodytes, Tursiops truncatus, Felis catus, Mus musculus)" ;
