<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Van Essen (1997), Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) & Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) cortico-cortical axonal tension and cortical folding — Code-to-model traceability: 68/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Documents the chord-vs-arc and laminar volume formulas (L32-41), but lacks explicit equation-to-code mappings to Van Essen (1997) Fig. 1-3, Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) Eq. 1-4 & Fig. 2-6, Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) Eq. 3-5, and the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_090_cortical_sulcal_axon_tension.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
