    pk:evidenceAgainst "2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py L32–L67: Brief docstrings without explicit paper figure/equation or Lean 4 theorem cross-references <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py#L32-L67>" ;
    pk:hasScore 6.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Van Essen (1997), Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) & Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) cortico-cortical axonal tension and cortical folding — Model fidelity to source: 56/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes analytical chord-vs-arc wiring volume savings (L32-35) and Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) isometric column thickness h = h0 / lambda_t (L38-41), backed by 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_090_cortical_sulcal_axon_tension.lean`. However, `generate_parametric_coronal_ribbon` (L44-67) prescribes a synthetic harmonic curve rather than relaxing a coupled elastoplastic cortical ribbon + viscoelastic white-matter axonal tension network over connectivity matrix C_ij with towed-axon growth dL_0/dt = gamma_a(T_ij - tau_0)_+ and axonal ablation controls." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py L44–L67: Synthetic cosine coronal contour instead of viscoelastic axonal tension relaxation <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py#L44-L67>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Van Essen (1997), Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) & Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) cortico-cortical axonal tension and cortical folding — Morphometric validation: 55/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L164-192) reports 3 analytical metrics, but does not measure emergent wiring economy or gyral/sulcal thickness ratios from a relaxed mechanical network, does not compute the 12-species MHH universal scaling exponent alpha = 1.25, and extracts zero computer-vision metrics from the coronal brain specimen image." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py L164–L192: Only 3 analytical metrics returned without mechanical relaxation or specimen CV metrics <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py#L164-L192>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-measurement-hilgetag-barbas-2006-gyral-crown-cortical-thickness-h-gyrus>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-measurement-hilgetag-barbas-2006-gyral-to-sulcal-thickness-ratio-h-gyrus-h-fundus>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-measurement-macaque-v1-v2-gyral-chord-to-arc-wiring-ratio-van-essen-1997> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Van Essen (1997), Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) & Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) cortico-cortical axonal tension and cortical folding — MorphoEval overall 53.9/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py` (overall weighted score: 55.8/100). The v1 script computes analytical chord-vs-arc wiring savings (Van Essen 1997) and isometric cortical column volume conservation (Hilgetag & Barbas 2006), but uses a synthetic cosine contour instead of solving coupled viscoelastic cortico-cortical axonal tension mechanics across a connectivity matrix C_ij with towed-axon growth, omits the 12-species Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) universal scaling collapse and axonal ablation controls, and does not segment the vendored coronal brain specimen image. Overall 53.9/100 (faithfulness 47.0, reproducibility 70.0); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 56, Morphological realism / specimen match 35, Parameter expressivity 47, Morphometric validation 55, Source and data traceability 74, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension_comparison.png: rendered output of 2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py at 8871db0, image/png, 223333 B, 1625×1170 px, artifact_sha256 c8f0ef043aac3299bc8458680e4da0a77813397b803ba11454f9b7914eed9aa8 (sha256 c8f0ef043aac3299bc8458680e4da0a77813397b803ba11454f9b7914eed9aa8), spec_fingerprint 84c495a5d45894646a6161c31d7690d7bf05b858d5926075a0791c491fd2603b. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 84c495a5d45894646a6161c31d7690d7bf05b858d5926075a0791c491fd2603b; artifact_sha256: c8f0ef043aac3299bc8458680e4da0a77813397b803ba11454f9b7914eed9aa8; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/coronal_cortex_axon_tracts_specimen.jpg=ff9a25e993fd5aad..., datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension_reference.json=51d4ed1c896638d9..., datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/paper_citations.bib=bcd7b0529c1c497d..., datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/scout_manifest.json=3ef66e67c6994708...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add runtime SHA-256 verification of all 4 files in `datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/`, expose full CLI parameters (`--axon-stiffness`, `--bending-modulus`, `--towed-gamma`, `--growth-g`, `--seed`), and expand `self_test()` and `measure_morphoeval()` to 9 quantitative reference-anchored metrics.",
        "remediation needed: Implement axonal tension ablation / callosotomy (k_a = 0), hyper-connected tract (k_a = 2.40), and lissencephalic (k_a = 0, g = 1.0) controls, plus Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) gyral-vs-sulcal laminar thickness profiling (h_gyrus / h_fundus) and the full 12-species Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) universal scaling collapse log10(A_T * sqrt(h)) = 1.25 * log10(A_E) + log10(k).",
        "remediation needed: Implement computer-vision segmentation of `datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/coronal_cortex_axon_tracts_specimen.jpg` to extract pial and white-matter contours, outward gyral crowns vs inward sulcal fundi, empirical gyral-to-sulcal cortical thickness ratio h_gyrus / h_fundus, and coronal Gyrification Index GI.",
        "remediation needed: Replace the parametric cosine ribbon with a coupled 2D coronal elastoplastic cortical ribbon + viscoelastic cortico-cortical white-matter axonal tract network over connectivity matrix C_ij with towed-axon rest-length adaptation dL_{0,ij}/dt = gamma_a * max(0, T_ij - tau_0) and L-BFGS-B mechanical relaxation, demonstrating outward gyral folding across strongly connected regions and inward sulcal fundi at weakly connected boundaries." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.39e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
